  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GCFF GUARANTEE FACILITY- CBOJ</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Global Authorization to provide partial portfolio guarantees to local private sector financial intermediaries (PSFIs), either banks or microfinance institutions (MFIs), under the Global Concessional Finance Facility (GCFF) - Private Sector Operations framework. The objective of the GCFF is to support middle income countries impacted by the influx of refugees, in this case Jordan as a pilot country. The facility will provide partial risk protection to PSFIs in form of guarantees on underlying debt-financing granted to MSMEs on a portfolio basis. The objective of the facility is to promote financial inclusion of refugees and host communities as well as further underserved segments of the economy, and to contribute to improved access to finance of MSMEs meeting the eligibility criteria of the facility.</narrative>
  </description>
